      "releaseNotes": "New Features\n• Hybrid proxies now support more SOCKS connection methods: added SOCKS4 and SOCKS4a support, and compatibility with SOCKS5 connections that use username-and-password authentication only.\n\nImprovements\n• Improved the accuracy of direct connection latency tests.\n• QR codes and share links can now import more proxy configurations: support for additional node formats, while preserving supported TLS, REALITY, and transport settings. Parameters that cannot be safely preserved will be rejected during import.\n\nFixes\n• Improved Tailscale node version detection: the Tailscale admin console can now correctly identify Stash node versions and manage node settings.\n• Fixed StashLink device identity recovery: if identity credentials can’t be used, the app will try to obtain new ones and preserve existing valid credentials if renewal fails.",
