      "releaseNotes": "New Features\n• Exit location names are now displayed in the app's language\n• Automatically select a latency test target\n\nImprovements\n• Improved compatibility notices for Tailscale nodes\n• Improved error messages for body rewrite rules\n\nFixes\n• Complex rewrite rules no longer cause crashes\n• Fixed cached data being lost after restarting\n• Fixed browsing failures on some websites\n• Fixed VLESS Vision connections getting stuck: some TLS 1.3 requests can now continue connecting as expected.\n• Automatically retry StashLink initialization after network recovery\n• Fixed a crash when deleting an override\n• Improved device syncing on restricted networks",
